      "content": "The thought of stopping is a very real, very serious signal of how much pain you are in right now. If the cycle feels inescapable and the weight of existence is too much, please know that there are people who want to listen to you without judgment. You can reach out immediately to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline by calling or texting 988 anytime. Please make that call; they are trained to help you through this moment.",
      "source": "target",
